flowchart TB
  Draft["A manager saves a draft<br/>year, currency, annual amount, Q1 to Q4,<br/>member and vertical cells"] --> Checks["Approve: one transaction with the plan row locked<br/>caller is a manager, plan is still a draft,<br/>Q1 to Q4 equal the annual amount,<br/>each quarter's cells equal the quarter,<br/>staff and verticals are active"]
  Checks -- "any check fails" --> Kept["Refused, and the draft is kept"]
  Checks -- "all pass" --> Locked["Approved and locked<br/>no further edits by anyone"]
  Receipts["Recognized contributions<br/>recorded separately"] --> Compare["Actual against the fixed targets<br/>per currency and period"]
  Locked --> Compare
  Compare --> Note["Overachievement stays in its quarter<br/>later targets are unchanged"]
